#: scenario8:scenario8_1A890836_AEF6_4EB3_93EF_932A32879E02
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e5a1f13891e3ec6135535c125ab4f9533d3dd4397d141b0082c4e09b1655c09b
